### Nomos - Update and Delete Operations
### Run these AFTER 01-setup.http

### ============================================================
### Update Operations
### ============================================================

### Update IDP issuer URL
PUT http://localhost:8080/nomos/v1/api/admin/idp/auth0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "issuer": "https://new-auth0.example.com"
}

### Update audience label
PUT http://localhost:8080/nomos/v1/api/admin/app/mobile-app-br/idp/auth0?aud=mobile-br-auth0-client
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "audience": "mobile-br-auth0-client",
  "label": "Mobile BR Production v2"
}

### ============================================================
### Delete Operations
### ============================================================

### Delete a specific audience (removes USES_IDP + all ACCESS_PROXY for that audience)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/nomos/v1/api/admin/app/mobile-app-br/idp/keycloak?aud=mobile-br-kc-internal

### Verify: mobile-app-br audiences should now only show auth0
GET http://localhost:8080/nomos/v1/api/admin/app/mobile-app-br/audiences

### Delete an entire app (removes App node + all relationships)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/nomos/v1/api/admin/app/chatbot-service

### Verify: chatbot-service should no longer appear in account-service apps
GET http://localhost:8080/nomos/v1/api/admin/proxy/account-service/apps
